WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.907
Every story starts somewhere. Let's find this one.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.020
India.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.098
Maharashtra.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:10.634
Pune.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.547
Home to one website.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.956
Sanket Tambare dot in.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.780
Since twenty nineteen, there's been a YouTube channel here too.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.780
Talks on blogging, and a promo watched over eleven thousand times.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.480
A trail run up Sinhagad.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.080
And this year, live readings of the essays.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.380
Every race, fort and book, counted. No videos.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.180
By hand: twelve fields, sixteen times over.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.088
So, let's cut the ribbon.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.280
Introducing: Videos.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.499
Live now, on Sanket Tambare dot in.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:45.080
Every upload on the channel, long videos and Shorts, on one page.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.359
One tap splits the Shorts from the rest.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:52.765
Search it. Filter by year, tag or playlist.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.023
Or sort by what got watched.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.580
Thirteen thousand six hundred views, eighty minutes of video.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.543
And it plays right here. Nothing loads from YouTube until you press play.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.621
Adding them? One button.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:10.043
Sync now asks YouTube's Data API for every public upload,

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.080
Checks which ones are Shorts,

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.311
And a Cloudflare Worker writes them into the site's database.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.580
Before: one hundred and ninety-two copy-pastes.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:19.791
Now: one click.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:21.687
Made in Pune.

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.285
For every upload still to come.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.626
Sanket Tambare dot in, slash videos.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:28.466
See you there.
